    "text": "Let G be a group generated by finite number n of involutions in which\n(uv)4 = 1 for all involutions u, v ∈ G. Is it true that G is finite? is a 2-group? This\nis true for n ⩽ 3.\n    Editors’ comment of 2021: the previously published claim of an affirmative solu-\ntion of this problem proved to be erroneous.                               D. V. Lytkina",
